WEBVTT

00:12:29.363 --> 00:12:31.397
When we go, "I'm always going to be sad,"

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.563
or "I'm never going to be happy again."

00:12:33.563 --> 00:12:35.663
No, you don't know what tomorrow is like,

00:12:35.697 --> 00:12:37.363
but today you're feeling sad.

00:12:37.397 --> 00:12:40.030
Just name your feelings for today.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:41.897
CSB: Yeah.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.663
Thank you, David, this has been
really, really meaningful,

00:12:44.697 --> 00:12:46.597
and we've learned so much from you.

00:12:46.597 --> 00:12:48.530
So thanks for joining us.

00:12:48.563 --> 00:12:49.563
DK: Thank you.

00:12:49.597 --> 00:12:50.763
CSB: Have a great day.